OL,3,AInternet restricted after fighting
OL,4,Abreaks out in Ethiopia's Tigray region
OL,5,
OL,6,FInternet and call services have been
OL,7,Fdisrupted in Ethiopia's northern region
OL,8,Fof Tigray after fighting broke out this
OL,9,Fweek between regional forces and the
OL,10,Fnational army.
OL,12,FServices provided by state-owned
OL,13,Ftelecoms operator Ethio Telecom have
OL,14,Fbeen completely cut, although those
OL,15,Ffrom the much smaller private firm
OL,16,FSafaricom remain operational. Internet
OL,17,Fmonitoring group NetBlocks earlier
OL,18,Fposted on X that network data indicated
OL,19,Fa sub-national internet shutdown in
OL,20,Fnorthern Tigray.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
