OL,3,AInternet restricted after fighting
OL,4,Abreaks out in Ethiopia's Tigray region
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Last night telecommunications got
OL,7,Fknocked out," Duke Burbridge, an
OL,8,FAmerican humanitarian worker in
OL,9,FTigray's capital, Mekelle, told the
OL,10,FBBC's Newsday programme.
OL,12,FThe BBC has contacted Ethiopia's
OL,13,Fauthorities for comment.
